msgid "Disconnect to change this setting."
msgstr "この設定を変更するには、一度切断してください。"

#: client/scenes/gui_settings.cpp:232
msgid "Refresh rate"
msgstr "リフレッシュレート"

#: client/scenes/gui_settings.cpp:233
msgid ""
"Use 'auto' to select the refresh rate based on measured application "
"performance. May cause flicker when a change happens."
msgstr ""
"アプリの負荷に合わせてリフレッシュレートを自動調整します。変更時に画面がちら"
"つく場合があります。"

#: client/scenes/gui_settings.cpp:256
msgctxt "automatic refresh rate, use a short string"
msgid "Auto"
msgstr "自動"

#: client/scenes/gui_settings.cpp:269
msgid "Render resolution"
msgstr "レンダー解像度"

#: client/scenes/gui_settings.cpp:270
#, c++-format
msgctxt "render resolution"
msgid "Pixels rendered per eye ({}x{}). Lower to gain performance."
msgstr ""
"片目あたりのレンダリング解像度 ({}x{})。下げるとパフォーマンスが向上します。"

#: client/scenes/gui_settings.cpp:287
msgid "Application SpaceWarp"
msgstr "アプリケーション・スペースワープ"

#: client/scenes/gui_settings.cpp:288
msgid "Renders at half the refresh rate. The headset may synthesise frames."
msgstr ""
"リフレッシュレートの半分にします。ヘッドセットがフレームを補間する場合があり"
"ます。"

#: client/scenes/gui_settings.cpp:294
msgid "Set a refresh rate other than auto to enable this setting."
msgstr "リフレッシュレートを「自動」以外に設定すると有効になります。"

#: client/scenes/gui_settings.cpp:298
msgctxt "page header title"
msgid "Video"
msgstr "ビデオ"

#: client/scenes/gui_settings.cpp:298
msgctxt "page header subtitle"
msgid "Frame rate and resolution."
msgstr "フレームレートおよび解像度"

#: client/scenes/gui_settings.cpp:311
msgid "Foveated encoding"
msgstr "エンコード・フォビエーション"

#: client/scenes/gui_settings.cpp:313
msgid ""
"Higher values focus image quality where you look at, improving latency, "
"power efficiency and quality."
msgstr ""
"値を上げることで視線先の画質を最適化し、低遅延・省電力・高画質を実現します。"

#: client/scenes/gui_settings.cpp:314
msgid ""
"Higher values focus image quality at the center, improving latency, power "
"efficiency and quality."
msgstr ""
"値を上げると中心の画質が最適化され、低遅延・省電力・高画質を実現します。"

#: client/scenes/gui_settings.cpp:332 client/scenes/gui_settings.cpp:344
msgctxt "Codec"
msgid "Automatic"
msgstr "自動"

#: client/scenes/gui_settings.cpp:336
msgctxt "Codec"
msgid "H.264"
msgstr "H.264"

#: client/scenes/gui_settings.cpp:338
msgctxt "Codec"
msgid "HEVC (H.265)"
msgstr "HEVC (H.265)"

#: client/scenes/gui_settings.cpp:340
msgctxt "Codec"
msgid "AV1"
msgstr "AV1"

#: client/scenes/gui_settings.cpp:354 client/scenes/gui_settings.cpp:367
msgctxt "setting name"
msgid "Video codec"
msgstr "コーデック"

#: client/scenes/gui_settings.cpp:355
msgid "How video is compressed before it is sent to the headset."
msgstr "ビデオをヘッドセットに送る際の圧縮方法です。"

#: client/scenes/gui_settings.cpp:377
msgctxt "setting name"
msgid "10-bit color"
msgstr "10ビット色深度"

#: client/scenes/gui_settings.cpp:378
msgid "Higher color precision, supported by HEVC and AV1."
msgstr "色再現性が向上します。HEVCおよびAV1でサポートされています。"

#: client/scenes/gui_settings.cpp:391
msgid "Bitrate"
msgstr "ビットレート"

#: client/scenes/gui_settings.cpp:392
msgid "Video data rate sent to the headset."
msgstr "ヘッドセットへのビデオデータ転送速度。"

#: client/scenes/gui_settings.cpp:407
msgctxt "setting name"
msgid "Foveation center override"
msgstr "フォービエーション中心点の調整"

#: client/scenes/gui_settings.cpp:408
msgid ""
"Manually set where image quality is focused, instead of the center or your "
"gaze."
msgstr "中心や視線に頼らず、画質のフォーカス位置を手動で設定します。"

#: client/scenes/gui_settings.cpp:420
msgctxt "setting name"
msgid "Foveation center"
msgstr "フォービエーション中心点"

#: client/scenes/gui_settings.cpp:421
#, c++-format
msgid "Height {:.1f} °, distance {:.2f} m"
msgstr "高さ {:.1f} °, 距離 {:.2f} m"

#: client/scenes/gui_settings.cpp:423
msgctxt "button label to change the foveation center"
msgid "Change"
msgstr "編集"

#: client/scenes/gui_settings.cpp:426
msgid "Enable foveation center override to change this setting."
msgstr ""
"この設定を変更するには、「フォービエーション中心点の調整」を有効にしてくださ"
"い。"

#: client/scenes/gui_settings.cpp:430
msgctxt "page header title"
msgid "Streaming"
msgstr "ストリーミング"

#: client/scenes/gui_settings.cpp:430
msgctxt "page header subtitle"
msgid "How video is encoded and sent to the headset."
msgstr "ビデオのエンコードおよびヘッドセットへの送信設定"

#: client/scenes/gui_settings.cpp:435
msgctxt "confirmation messagebox title"
msgid "Disable in-stream window"
msgstr "体験中のウィンドウ表示を無効にする"

#: client/scenes/gui_settings.cpp:436
msgctxt "confirmation message"
msgid ""
"Do you really want to disable the in-stream window?\n"
"You will not be able to re-open it with the thumbsticks."
msgstr ""
"体験中のウィンドウを無効にしてもよろしいですか？\n"
"サムスティックによる再表示ができなくなります。"

#: client/scenes/gui_settings.cpp:437 client/scenes/lobby_gui.cpp:886
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "はい"

#: client/scenes/gui_settings.cpp:438 client/scenes/lobby_gui.cpp:893
msgid "No"
msgstr "いいえ"

#: client/scenes/gui_settings.cpp:459
msgctxt "openxr_post_processing"
msgid "Normal"
msgstr "ノーマル"

#: client/scenes/gui_settings.cpp:462
msgctxt "openxr_post_processing"
msgid "Quality"
msgstr "クオリティ"

#: client/scenes/gui_settings.cpp:464
msgctxt "openxr_post_processing"
msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "無効"

#: client/scenes/gui_settings.cpp:489
msgid "Supersampling"
msgstr "スーパーサンプリング"

#: client/scenes/gui_settings.cpp:489
msgid ""
"Reduce flicker for high contrast edges. Useful when the input resolution is "
"high compared to the headset display."
msgstr ""
"コントラストの強いエッジのちらつきを抑えます。入力解像度がヘッドセットのディ"
"スプレイ解像度よりも高い場合に有効です。"

#: client/scenes/gui_settings.cpp:490
msgid "Sharpening"
msgstr "シャープニング"

#: client/scenes/gui_settings.cpp:490
msgid ""
"Improve clarity of high contrast edges and counteract blur. Useful when the "
"input resolution is low compared to the headset display."
msgstr ""
"コントラストの強いエッジをくっきりさせ、ぼやけを解消します。入力解像度がヘッ"
"ドセットのディスプレイ解像度より低い場合に有効です。"

#: client/scenes/gui_settings.cpp:493
msgid "Post-processing"
msgstr "ポストエフェクト"

#: client/scenes/gui_settings.cpp:493
msgctxt "page header subtitle"
msgid "OpenXR layer supersampling and sharpening."
msgstr "OpenXR：スーパーサンプリングとシャープニング"

#: client/scenes/gui_settings.cpp:506
msgctxt "setting name"
msgid "Microphone"
msgstr "マイク"

#: client/scenes/gui_settings.cpp:507
msgid "Stream the headset microphone to the PC."
msgstr "マイク音声をPCへ出力"

#: client/scenes/gui_settings.cpp:518
msgctxt "setting name"
msgid "Unprocessed audio"
msgstr "未処理のマイク音声"

#: client/scenes/gui_settings.cpp:519
msgid "Disable audio filters, such as noise cancellation."
msgstr "ノイズキャンセリングなどのオーディオフィルターを無効にする"

#: client/scenes/gui_settings.cpp:528
msgctxt "page header title"
msgid "Audio"
msgstr "オーディオ"

#: client/scenes/gui_settings.cpp:528
msgctxt "page header subtitle"
msgid "Microphone streamed to the PC."
msgstr "ヘッドセットマイクのPC送信設定"

#: client/scenes/gui_settings.cpp:540
msgctxt "setting name"
msgid "Keyboard"
msgstr "キーボード"

#: client/scenes/gui_settings.cpp:541
msgid "Forward the keyboard from the headset to the PC."
msgstr "ヘッドセットに接続したキーボードの入力をPCに転送します。"

#: client/scenes/gui_settings.cpp:550
msgctxt "setting name"
msgid "Mouse"
msgstr "マウス"

#: client/scenes/gui_settings.cpp:551
msgid "Forward the mouse from the headset to the PC."
msgstr "ヘッドセットに接続したマウスの入力をPCに転送します。"

#: client/scenes/gui_settings.cpp:560
msgctxt "setting name"
msgid "Gamepad"
msgstr "ゲームコントローラー"

#: client/scenes/gui_settings.cpp:561
msgid "Forward the gamepad from the headset to the PC."
msgstr "ヘッドセットに接続したゲームコントローラーの入力をPCに転送します。"

#: client/scenes/gui_settings.cpp:568
msgctxt "page header title"
msgid "Devices"
msgstr "デバイス"

#: client/scenes/gui_settings.cpp:568
msgctxt "page header subtitle"
msgid "Forward input devices to the PC."
msgstr "入力デバイスのPC転送設定"

#: client/scenes/gui_settings.cpp:572 client/scenes/stream_network.cpp:91
msgid "The server does not allow forwarded input devices"
msgstr "サーバー側で入力デバイスの転送が許可されていません。"

#: client/scenes/gui_settings.cpp:597
msgctxt "setting name"
msgid "Hand tracking"
msgstr "ハンドトラッキング"

#: client/scenes/gui_settings.cpp:597
msgid "Track your hands for input when controllers are down."
msgstr "コントローラーを離した際、手の動きで操作を行います。"

#: client/scenes/gui_settings.cpp:600
msgctxt "setting name"
msgid "Eye tracking"
msgstr "アイトラッキング"

#: client/scenes/gui_settings.cpp:600
msgid "Used by foveated encoding to focus quality where you look."
msgstr ""
"フォービエーションに使用され、視線が向いている場所の画質を向上させます。"

#: client/scenes/gui_settings.cpp:603
msgctxt "setting name"
msgid "Face tracking"
msgstr "フェーストラッキング"

#: client/scenes/gui_settings.cpp:603
msgid "Stream facial expressions to the PC."
msgstr "表情データをPCに送信します。"

